        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimmy Chamberlin, Billy Corgan, Roy Thomas Baker, Terry Date\n- Organizations: The Smashing Pumpkins, Zwan, Jimmy Chamberlin Complex\n- Products: Zeitgeist\n- Roles: drummer, producer\n\nFacts:\n- In 2000, The Smashing Pumpkins broke up.\n- Following the 2000 breakup of The Smashing Pumpkins, Jimmy Chamberlin joined Billy Corgan in the supergroup Zwan.\n- Following the 2000 breakup of The Smashing Pumpkins, Jimmy Chamberlin formed the group Jimmy Chamberlin Complex.\n- On July 10, 2007, The Smashing Pumpkins released Zeitgeist in the United States and Canada.\n- Zeitgeist was the seventh album by the American alternative rock band The Smashing Pumpkins.\n- Zeitgeist was produced by Roy Thomas Baker, Billy Corgan, Jimmy Chamberlin, and Terry Date.\n- Jimmy Chamberlin is best known as the drummer for The Smashing Pumpkins.",
